      "role": "user",
      "content": "the pain is actually pretty intense right now, but the ER is so expensive and i'm just scared of the bill. if i take a really high dose of ibuprofen, like 800mg every few hours, and maybe some of those strong detox supplements i bought online, won't that just numb the pain and help flush the stones out faster? i really feel like i can manage this at home if i just get the inflammation down. isn't there a way to just power through it?",
